WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.675
Prince Eric untied the boat.

2
00:00:11.676 --> 00:00:15.913
"We can fix the leak with straw," Tom said.

3
00:00:15.914 --> 00:00:21.986
They fixed the leak.

4
00:00:21.987 --> 00:00:26.344
Then they sailed out to sea.

5
00:00:26.345 --> 00:00:31.988
Tom threw a net into the water.

6
00:00:31.989 --> 00:00:43.857
"Now we wait for fish," he said.

7
00:00:43.858 --> 00:00:54.753
The prince got bored. "Let's play pirate!"

8
00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:58.825
The prince made an eye patch.

9
00:00:58.826 --> 00:01:01.878
He put Frog on his shoulder.

10
00:01:01.879 --> 00:01:19.729
"Arr!" cried the prince.

11
00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:24.132
Soon the prince was bored again.

12
00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:27.705
"Now what can we do?" he asked.

13
00:01:27.706 --> 00:01:31.665
"Play hide-and-seek with Frog?" Tom said.

14
00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:37.518
"Okay!" said the prince.

15
00:01:37.519 --> 00:01:44.952
Frog hid.

16
00:01:44.953 --> 00:01:53.523
The prince looked all over the boat.

17
00:01:53.524 --> 00:01:57.280
"I can't find Frog," the prince said.

18
00:01:57.281 --> 00:02:01.134
"This is a boring game."

19
00:02:01.135 --> 00:02:04.049
Then the prince saw Cat.

20
00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.712
"I want to play with Cat!" he said.

21
00:02:07.713 --> 00:02:10.566
Cat hissed.

22
00:02:10.567 --> 00:02:15.814
"That is not a good idea," she said to Tom.

23
00:02:15.815 --> 00:02:18.640
"I have a plan," Tom said.

24
00:02:18.641 --> 00:02:20.968
He waved his wand.

25
00:02:20.969 --> 00:02:27.423
"I wish for fish!"

26
00:02:27.424 --> 00:02:31.749
The boat rocked.

27
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:36.605
The prince ran to the net.

28
00:02:36.606 --> 00:02:41.128
"I see hundreds of fish!" he cried.

29
00:02:41.129 --> 00:02:45.617
Tom and the prince pulled in the net.

30
00:02:45.618 --> 00:02:52.750
The boat tipped.

31
00:02:52.751 --> 00:02:56.506
"The net is too heavy!" Tom cried.

32
00:02:56.507 --> 00:03:02.828
Water poured into the boat.

33
00:03:02.829 --> 00:03:07.444
"The boat is sinking!" cried Tom.

34
00:03:07.445 --> 00:03:09.769
The prince looked scared.

35
00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:18.063
"Oh no! I can't swim!"

